stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Preparing: Dataset and profile admitted
    Preparing --> Preparing: Register file group, verify bytes, checkpoint prefix
    Preparing --> Ready: Verified manifest published
    Ready --> Ready: Preparation-only run held
    Ready --> Admitting: Execution requested and creation lease claimed
    Admitting --> Ready: Read failure or caller interruption yields lease
    Admitting --> Admitting: Replay bounded placement commits and acknowledge pages
    Admitting --> Failed: Immutable seed conflict
    Failed --> [*]: No dispatch
    Admitting --> Pending: Exact local coverage and fenced activation
    Preparing --> Cancelled: Cancellation fences publication
    Ready --> Cancelled: Cancellation revokes execution intent
    Admitting --> Cancelled: Close partial local admission
    Pending --> [*]: Coordinator dispatch owns execution
    Cancelled --> [*]: Delayed creators rejected
